OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new hospital building to
OL,4,Abe redone
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NHS has confirmed work on a new
OL,7,Fhospital will have to be redone.
OL,9,FNorthumbria Healthcare NHS Trust said
OL,10,Fthe new Berwick Community Hospital will
OL,11,Fneed to be stripped back to its
OL,12,Fstructural steelwork after inspections
OL,13,Ffound building work carried out so far
OL,14,Fwas not up to standard.
OL,16,FNew contractors Robertson have been
OL,17,Fworking with the trust to determine
OL,18,Fwhat will need to be done for the
OL,19,Fscheme to progress - additional costs
OL,20,Fto the #35m project are currently
OL,21,Funknown.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
