OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new hospital building to
OL,4,Abe redone
OL,5,
OL,6,FDamon Kent, executive director of
OL,7,Festates and facilities, said while the
OL,8,Fwork so far will not be demolished,
OL,9,Finternal work and some of the facade
OL,10,Fwill have to be removed.
